Subject: [PATCH 0011] Prism: agent-in-control banner + Dock badge sources

Compiles the Phase 5 chrome-layer additions into static_library("ui"):
- prism_dock_badge.h / prism_dock_badge_mac.mm: the macOS Dock tile badge
  counting agent-controlled spaces (driven by the delegate's 1s sync)
- the agent-in-control ConfirmInfoBar (Take over / Stop agent) itself
  lives in prism_space_window_delegate.cc, already listed by patch 0008
- infobar_delegate.h + enums.xml: append PRISM_AGENT_BANNER_INFOBAR_DELEGATE
  to the InfoBarIdentifier enum (LINT.IfChange/ThenChange pair kept in sync)

The BUILD.gn sources are inserted past patch 0008's hunk context so every
patch in the series stays individually reverse-applicable.

diff --git a/chrome/browser/ui/BUILD.gn b/chrome/browser/ui/BUILD.gn
index 90952d43b6..77838aad7c 100644
--- a/chrome/browser/ui/BUILD.gn
+++ b/chrome/browser/ui/BUILD.gn
@@ -1423,6 +1423,9 @@ static_library("ui") {
       "browser_command_controller.h",
       "browser_commands.cc",
       "browser_commands.h",
+      # Prism: agent-in-control banner + Dock badge (Phase 5, mac-only).
+      "//chrome/browser/prism/prism_dock_badge.h",
+      "//chrome/browser/prism/prism_dock_badge_mac.mm",
       "browser_content_setting_bubble_model_delegate.cc",
       "browser_content_setting_bubble_model_delegate.h",
       "browser_live_tab_context.cc",
